 run migrations",[551,574,575,579],{},[566,576,577],{},[537,578,186],{"href":434},[566,580,581],{},"Set credentials, offers and tenant scope",[551,583,584,588],{},[566,585,586],{},[537,587,437],{"href":438},[566,589,590],{},"Add billing helpers to your user or team model",[551,592,593,597],{},[566,594,595],{},[537,596,441],{"href":442},[566,598,599],{},"Start a purchase with a durable retry key",[551,601,602,606],{},[566,603,604],{},[537,605,206],{"href":448},[566,607,608],{},"Open hosted billing for an authorized customer",[551,610,611,615],{},[566,612,613],{},[537,614,88],{"href":445},[566,616,617],{},"Inspect, cancel, resume and reconcile owned subscriptions",[551,619,620,624],{},[566,621,622],{},[537,623,50],{"href":451},[566,625,626],{},"Verify, deduplicate and persist deliveries atomically",[551,628,629,633],{},[566,630,631],{},[537,632,454],{"href":455},[566,634,635],{},"Inspect billing records without editing them",[551,637,638,642],{},[566,639,640],{},[537,641,58],{"href":458},[566,643,644],{},"Exercise checkout and signed webhooks offline",[551,646,647,651],{},[566,648,649],{},[537,650,376],{"href":461},[566,652,653],{},"Run contributor checks and understand release tooling",[484,655,656,657,662],{},"Python 3.10+; Django 5.2 LTS, 6.0 and 6.1 within their supported Python ranges.\nCode samples are executed with the published packages and local fixtures.\nSee the ",[537,658,293],{"href":659,"rel":660},"https:\u002F\u002Fdocs.vatly.com\u002Fapi-reference",[661],"nofollow"," for Vatly's fields.",[664,665,666],"style",{},"html pre.shiki code .sBMFI, html code.shiki .sBMFI{--shiki-light:#E2931D;--shiki-default:#FFCB6B;--shiki-dark:#FFCB6B}html pre.shiki code .sfazB, html code.shiki .sfazB{--shiki-light:#91B859;--shiki-default:#C3E88D;--shiki-dark:#C3E88D}html .light .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-light);background: var(--shiki-light-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-light-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-light-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-light-text-